{"4420180": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FOG", "steam_appid": 4420180, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A fun road trip where nothing bad is going to happen!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          In <i>FOG</i>, you have just escaped a murderous cult that has now summoned a ginormous being to track you down. It and the ones it controls will stop at nothing to hunt you down while you hop in your RV and select locations from your map to find food, money, and anything else you can use to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras/ae53bdd98ca40eec197977c682d43eb3.avif?t=1783202122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras_big/ae53bdd98ca40eec197977c682d43eb3.webp?t=1783202122 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          Activate radio towers to damage the man watching you. Visit treasure zones to loot corpses and salvage the remains of what the creatures lurking in the fog have left behind. Visit shops that sell some questionable products. From forests to mountains to towns to ranches, the places you go will make every run unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras/09e394c5526c7064055b6ac5be6539ee.avif?t=1783202122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras_big/09e394c5526c7064055b6ac5be6539ee.webp?t=1783202122 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          Run, hide, and do whatever it takes to survive the 12 unique monsters lurking around every corner. Some can hear you. Some can see you. Some don't like eye contact. Some like it too much. The creatures you encounter may vary depending on your progress on your journey. Learn what you can about each one and plan accordingly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras/cff0a09155413616848505107acdda9f.avif?t=1783202122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras_big/cff0a09155413616848505107acdda9f.webp?t=1783202122 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          Use the items you find along the way to deal with what tries to kill you. Low health? Drink some Bruce Juice! Feeling bored? Turn on some music to jam out using your loudspeaker! Getting confronted by a cultist? Let’s hope that gun you bought was real!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras/deba71d01c705205b91a011ed930fd5d.avif?t=1783202122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras_big/deba71d01c705205b91a011ed930fd5d.webp?t=1783202122 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          Are you into lore? This game has tons of it. Each question you find the answer to is just going to lead to more questions! Get out the corkboard because the contents of this game will get you scratching your head as you dig through the files and obsess over tiny details that really don't matter! <br><br>          Whether you want to <span class=\"bb_strike\">write the lore for me</span> find the secrets of the lore, let out a good scream, optimize your runs, break the game inside and out, or just have a casual experience while you try not to piss yourself, this game has something for everyone.</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>A fun road trip where nothing bad is going to happen!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          In <i>FOG</i>, you have just escaped a murderous cult that has now summoned a ginormous being to track you down. It and the ones it controls will stop at nothing to hunt you down while you hop in your RV and select locations from your map to find food, money, and anything else you can use to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras/ae53bdd98ca40eec197977c682d43eb3.avif?t=1783202122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras_big/ae53bdd98ca40eec197977c682d43eb3.webp?t=1783202122 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          Activate radio towers to damage the man watching you. Visit treasure zones to loot corpses and salvage the remains of what the creatures lurking in the fog have left behind. Visit shops that sell some questionable products. From forests to mountains to towns to ranches, the places you go will make every run unique.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras/09e394c5526c7064055b6ac5be6539ee.avif?t=1783202122\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4420180/extras_big/09e394c5526c7064055b6ac5be6539ee.webp?t=1783202122 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >          Run,